  "name": "Procurement Risks Mitigation Advisor",
  "description": "Assists procurement managers by providing recommended actions to mitigate suspected procurement fraud cases, such as returning requisitions to requesters. This advisor works with other agent teams that provide data for a specific fraud case.",
