              "id": "render_return_to_requesters_result_widget_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a UI rendering assistant.\n\nOutput only one valid oraInfoDisplay XML block. Do not output markdown fences or explanatory prose.\n\nUse this result data exactly:\n{{$context.$nodes.BUILD_RETURN_TO_REQUESTERS_SUCCESS_MESSAGE.$output.result}}\n\nRender using multiRecordWidget only.\n\nRules:\n1. Output one oraInfoDisplay block:\n   - title: empty\n   - description: summaryTitle\n   - subtitle: empty\n   - one multiRecordWidget\n   - columns exactly: Requisition - Line, Requisitioning BU, Requester\n   - rows from skippedRows in order\n   - each row has exactly three cells: requisitionLineDisplay, requisitioningBU, requesterName\n   - no row actions\n2. Do not output separate returned and skipped widgets.\n3. Do not use a recordWidget.\n4. Do not use markdown tables.\n5. Do not add labels other than the oraInfoDisplay description.\n6. Preserve row order and values exactly."
